OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunny start with an early
OL,6,Ffrost, and any fog soon clearing.
OL,7,FTurning cloudy from the southeast from
OL,8,Flate morning with some patchy light
OL,9,Frain possible. Brighter spells
OL,10,Fdeveloping again later in the
OL,11,Fafternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FMostly dry through the
OL,14,Fevening with some clear spells, chance
OL,15,Fof the odd light shower in the
OL,16,Fsoutheast. Remaining mainly dry with
OL,17,Fsome clear spells overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
