OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FMostly dry through the day
OL,6,Fwith bright spells and just the odd
OL,7,Flight shower possible. Cloud and
OL,8,Foccasionally heavy rain spreading east
OL,9,Fthrough the evening. Windy at times.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FRain
OL,12,Fclearing Wednesday morning, then
OL,13,Fbright spells and scattered showers.
OL,14,FMostly dry Thursday with bright
OL,15,Fspells. Likely quite wet and windy
OL,16,FFriday morning, becoming more settled
OL,17,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
